*

* NOTE : FOR QUICKER CONVERSION PLACE THE NODESET 

*        V(Xyour.X1.131)=+4.2798 AND

*        V(Xyour.X1.141)=-4.2808 IN THE ROOT SIMULATION FILE.

*        ("Xyour" IS DEVICE NAME CALLED OUT IN THE ROOT FILE.)

*

*

